    {
      "id": "b3e797d39f604ac0aae52cc9b1c0e29d",
      "title": "The audit protects the investment decision.",
      "summary": null,
      "order": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "40f5c184a7d24974ab9415ca045cf1ae",
          "block_type": "corporate_section",
          "title": null,
          "components": [
            {
              "id": "3be09afdb3cb4c05a3eec9acc27e8981",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": null,
              "body": "PCG has an exceptional production base. At this scale, improving physical evacuation alone, without measuring the constraints that feed and receive it, may move the bottleneck rather than remove it.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "fb663bf787c045dea4cdf42336a7052f",
              "component_kind": "executive_summary",
              "title": null,
              "body": "Technical thesis Before freezing the conveyor, pallet-insertion, restacking, strapping and wrapping design, INGECART proposes measuring the complete cycle from each converter's final production point to finished-goods release. The result will be a vendor-neutral specification PCG can share with all suppliers.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "92491609fe0b41839490b9e043ee15b9",
              "component_kind": "executive_summary",
              "title": null,
              "body": "INGECART commitment Deliver immediate minimum-spend, maximum-output actions and the design, control and integration recommendations needed to capture the highest possible return from the future solution.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            }
          ],
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ],
