    {
      "id": "ee22e7fd55ed4cc2a5e40c08f7b96255",
      "title": "A fast conveyor does not correct a slow sequence.",
      "summary": null,
      "order": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "0bd5257eb2dd4a239c68cce9fa99a174",
          "block_type": "corporate_section",
          "title": null,
          "components": [
            {
              "id": "6d5f8ce89c2842eeb75bfc472988602a",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Shifted bottleneck",
              "body": "The new outfeed clears faster, but strapping, wrapping, restacking, quality control or pickup saturates next.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "9ea6eb27d6264e6397eeb4b70c45aef4",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Disconnected capacity",
              "body": "Equipment sized on average rate fails under peaks, large bundles, incomplete pallets, exceptions or recipe changes.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "5b9ce111ac9644928558ad308d18a4f5",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Control islands",
              "body": "PLCs and drives that could be automated remain isolated; priority, destination and recovery decisions stay manual.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "bdc37da0ca5a4dc6bcf9835469d43ee9",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Misread buffer",
              "body": "More accumulation may hide the problem, increase WIP and delay detection of a stopped downstream process.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "18fe0e70c5da40d1bfe1cb14ab14d69a",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Common availability",
              "body": "A shared architecture without bypass or degraded mode can turn one local fault into several stopped converters.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "ab1b12a249fd40ce97e5e8cbc8f03a4c",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Unreconciled units",
              "body": "Boxes/h, bundles/h, pallets/h and ft2/h are not interchangeable without recipe, count, pattern and mix.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "a15e6999c4be49509412a84fb9e94fd0",
              "component_kind": "executive_summary",
              "title": null,
              "body": "Decision question Which combination of capacity, buffer, redundancy and software keeps each converter below its acceptable blocking limit during foreseeable peaks and failures?",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
