    {
      "id": "9f6bb4ad73fc4eb9b81cd2591b27d71b",
      "title": "Size by event, concurrency and percentile.",
      "summary": null,
      "order": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "9925404307754e718c1fb3411d628926",
          "block_type": "corporate_section",
          "title": null,
          "components": [
            {
              "id": "6174feb9fcf64e9780826d6a25414802",
              "component_kind": "technical_specification",
              "title": null,
              "body": "Constrained good output = min(converter, bundler, restacker, pallet inserter, strapper, wrapper, conveyor, pickup) × system availability",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "21eed7166f2e40fa84f898770f51eda3",
              "component_kind": "technical_specification",
              "title": null,
              "body": "Recovered boxes = avoided blocked minutes × sustained good boxes/min Annual value = recovered boxes × unit contribution margin - incremental OPEX",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "d351e3eccde346d186addd5b6e638345",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Transparent example: one EVOL",
              "body": "At a theoretical 24,000 boxes/h, each blocked minute represents at most 400 unproduced boxes. Avoiding only 15 blocked minutes per shift represents up to 6,000 boxes per shift before applying mix, quality and availability.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "b8b7eb1037864d01818dba9c59e2d5fd",
              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Scale of three EVOLs",
              "body": "At combined theoretical peak, one common constrained minute represents at most 1,200 boxes. The audit will replace that maximum with observed good speed and cause-coded minutes.",
              "items": [],
              "props": {},
              "asset_ids": [],
              "style_tokens": [],
              "evidence_ids": [],
              "knowledge_keys": [],
              "semantic_labels": [],
              "confidence": 1.0
            },
            {
              "id": "526bdac5b09944308380fb36860cb258",
              "component_kind": "table",
              "title": null,
              "body": null,
              "items": [],
              "props": {
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "Metric",
                    "Calculation",
                    "Design use"
                  ],
                  [
