              "component_kind": "text",
              "title": "Day 1 · Gemba, baseline and loss taxonomy",
              "body": "Map routes and states; time cycles; capture formats, bundles and pallets; identify starvation, blocking, microstops, rehandling, operator waits and accumulation. Align tags and causes with production, maintenance and quality.",
